","sm":"le"},{"en":"of God.","sm":"Atua."}]},{"en":"For the fulness of mine intent is that I may persuade men to come unto the God of Abraham, and the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob, and be saved.","n":4,"sm":"Ona o le atoatoa o lo’u faamoemoe ia mafai ona ou faatauanauina tagata ia o mai i le Atua o Aperaamo, ma le Atua o Isaako, ma le Atua o Iakopo, ma faaolaina ai.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"For the fulness","sm":"atoatoa"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"lo’u"},{"en":"of mine intent","sm":"faamoemoe"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"mafai"},{"en":"is that I may","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"persuade","sm":"faatauanauina"},{"en":"men","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"to come","sm":"mai"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"unto","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"the God of Abraham,","sm":"Aperaamo,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"and the God of Isaac,","sm":"Isaako,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"and the God of Jacob,","sm":"Iakopo,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"faaolaina"},{"en":"and be saved.","sm":"ai."}]},{"en":"Wherefore, the things which are pleasing unto the world I do not write, but the things which are pleasing unto God and unto those who are not of the world.","n":5,"sm":"O le mea lea, o mea e fiafia i ai le lalolagi ou te lē tusia, ae o mea e fiafia i ai le Atua ma i latou o e e lē o ni o le lalolagi.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"O"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"mea"},{"en":"Wherefore,","sm":"lea,"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"the things","sm":"mea"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"fiafia"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"which please","sm":"ai"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the world","sm":"lalolagi"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"·","sm":"lē"},{"en":"I do not write,","sm":"tusia,"},{